      skos:note "When a memory has an H1 title but no explicit id field, the pipeline must NOT use the H1 title verbatim as the slug. The title is a display label; slug derivation follows a separate, controlled path (LLM id-gen or deterministic slugify). This fixture asserts that title and slug are decoupled." ;
      narr:theme "H1 title must not override or directly determine the pipeline-derived slug" .

